<p>Reports a call to a
<a href="https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/current/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/annotation/CachePut.html">@CachePut</a>
method made from inside a
<a href="https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/current/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/annotation/Cacheable.html">@Cacheable</a>
method when both target the same cache.</p>

While <code>@CachePut</code> forces method execution to update the cache, <code>@Cacheable</code> skips the execution of its body on a cache hit.
As a result, the <code>@CachePut</code> call is never reached once the surrounding result is cached, so the cache update is silently ignored.
